Subject: [PATCH 33/37] x86/ldt: Split out sanity check in map_ldt_struct()
Date: Mon, 23 Apr 2018 17:47:36 +0200
Message-Id: <1524498460-25530-34-git-send-email-joro@8bytes.org>
